{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16914","headline":"四川使宅有韦令公时孔雀存焉暇日与诸公同翫座中兼故府宾妓兴嗟久之因赋此诗用广其意 · 武元衡","name":"四川使宅有韦令公时孔雀存焉暇日与诸公同翫座中兼故府宾妓兴嗟久之因赋此诗用广其意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荀令昔居此，故巢留越禽。\n动摇金翠尾，飞舞碧梧阴。\n上客彻瑶瑟，美人伤蕙心。\n会因南国使，得放海云深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}